lit-docx — LitGravity document skill

Converters, publisher registry and templates, slop lint, visual audit and
page-fill checks are ported from the author's MIT-licensed
"publisher-docx-skill". Written for this port: scripts/qa_docx.py, the --kind
option of scripts/slop_lint.py, the PNG pages in scripts/visual_audit.py, and
the shared helpers that live in the sibling skill folder lit-pptx/scripts
(ooxml_integrity.py, render_pages.py, office-runtime.mjs,
office_runtime_bootstrap.py, office_data.py). The references/ documents were
written anew for LitGravity.

